description: One branch per phase or feature; user merges
alwaysApply: true
---

# Branching workflow

- Never commit feature/phase work directly on `main`
- Create a new branch for each phase or feature (e.g. `phase-0-foundation`, `phase-1-novacart-data`)
- Push the branch; do not merge to `main` — the user merges themselves
- Do not open PRs unless the user asks
